; Item action: cross that can be taken while the wheel is turned
;
; Room items of types 1 and 2 with this action are crosses; #R$A782 is the other set. Which set can be taken depends
; on the wheel of faith at #R$851E in room 17 (#R$A6A1): with the wheel at rest the #R$A782 crosses are the real ones (bright,
; cycling colours) and the #R$A777 crosses are drawn thin (frames 6-11); with the wheel turned it is the other way round.
; If Jean touches the cross while the wheel state bits (flag AND 7) are nonzero it is taken (#R$A78B), otherwise it is
; drawn by #R$A7B1.
;
; F Carry set when Jean's box overlaps the item's box
@label=ActionCrossWheelTurned
c$A777 JR NC,$A7B1   ;
 $A779 LD A,($851E)  ;
@isub=AND WHEEL_STATE_MASK
 $A77C AND $07       ; wheel state bits of #R$851E
 $A77E JR Z,$A7B1    ; wheel at rest: not takeable
 $A780 JR $A78B      ; take the cross
